# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local dev, OR set the same variables
# in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables for production.
#
# Note: Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.

# Google Maps Platform — one key, multiple APIs enabled in the same project:
#
#   • Places API (New)            — used by the address autocomplete in
#                                    PostDealModal.
#   • Street View Static API      — used by the Street View block on
#                                    deal detail pages.
#   • (optional) Maps Embed API   — for future interactive embeds.
#
# Get the key at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Enable each API listed above in: APIs & Services → Library
#
# Restrict the key to your domains (HTTP referrer):
#   - https://allstreetlive.com/*
#   - https://*.allstreetlive.com/*
#   - https://*.allstreetlive.pages.dev/*
#   - http://localhost:5173/*   (for local dev)
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
